The degree-of-confidence scale and the implicit answers follow the method of
SMART (University of Liege, https://smart.uliege.be/); the workflow is inspired
by Auto Multiple Choice (https://www.auto-multiple-choice.net/). Neither is
affiliated with this project; see README.md, References.
